"If you would like to allow the installation of Cacti Plugins from their "
"'develop' branch, check this checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Markera rutan för att tillåta installation av Cacti-insticksmoduler från "
"deras ”develop”-gren."

#: include/global_settings.php:615 package.php:785
