#: lib/utility.php:1212
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If using the Cacti Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine,"
" you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the "
"system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first "
"reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column"
" is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing "
"you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily "
"chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using "
"SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this "
"recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the "
"expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> "
"System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder Cacti Performance Booster med en minneslagringsmotor måste du"
" tömma bufferten innan minnestabellen får slut på utrymme. Det kan göras på "
"två sätt: minska utdatakolumnen till lämplig storlek i tabellerna "
"poller_output och poller_output_boost eller tilldela mer minne till "
"minnestabellerna. Det rekommenderade värdet är 10%% av systemminnet, men med"
" SSD-enheter eller ett mindre system kan du ignorera rekommendationen eller "
"välja en annan lagringsmotor. Du kan se tabellernas förväntade "
"minnesanvändning under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php:1224
msgid ""
"If this number is negative, reduce the innodb_buffer_pool_size until the "
"join_buffer_size turns positive, but allocate approximately from between "
"25%-50% of memory to the innodb_buffer_pool_size if the database is hosted "
"on the Cacti server, or upto 80% of the systems memory if the database is "
"separate from the Cacti web server.  However, try to not go below the "
"default of 262,144.  When performing joins, if they are below this size, "
"they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this "
"is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it"
" too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + "
"read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size +"
" Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80% if the database is hosted on "
"the Cacti web server and less if you intend to have very large RRDfiles or "
"hundreds of thousands to millions long term."
msgstr ""
"Om talet är negativt, minska innodb_buffer_pool_size tills join_buffer_size "
"blir positivt. Tilldela ungefär 25–50 % av minnet till "
"innodb_buffer_pool_size om databasen finns på Cacti-servern, eller upp till "
"80 % av systemminnet om databasen ligger på en separat server. Försök dock "
"att inte gå under standardvärdet 262 144. Vid sammanfogningar hålls data "
"under denna storlek i minnet i stället för att skrivas till en temporär fil."
" Eftersom minnet tilldelas per anslutning bör värdet inte sättas för högt. "
"Summan av join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + "
"read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + grundminnet för "
"MySQL/MariaDB bör vara under 80 % om databasen finns på Cacti-webbservern "
"och lägre om du på sikt planerar mycket stora RRD-filer eller "
"hundratusentals till miljontals RRD-filer."

#: lib/utility.php:1230
msgid ""
"If this number is negative, reduce the innodb_buffer_pool_size until the "
"sort_buffer_size turns positive, but allocate approximately from between "
"25%-50% of memory to the innodb_buffer_pool_size if the database is hosted "
"on the Cacti server, or upto 80% of the system memory if the database is "
"separate from the Cacti web server.  However, try to not go below the "
"default setting of 2,097,152.  A sort buffer performs sorts for some queries"
" using ORDER BY or GROUP BY. Configuring sort_buffer_size decides how much "
"memory will be allocated for sort queries.  The sort_buffer_size may need to"
" be adjusted from the default if the workload requires a significant number "
"of sort queries. The sort_buffer_size is defined on a per-session variable."
"  Use the same equation as that of the join_buffer_size to determine the per"
" connection possible memory."
msgstr ""
"Om talet är negativt, minska innodb_buffer_pool_size tills sort_buffer_size "
"blir positivt. Tilldela ungefär 25–50 % av minnet till "
"innodb_buffer_pool_size om databasen finns på Cacti-servern, eller upp till "
"80 % av systemminnet om databasen ligger på en separat server. Försök dock "
"att inte gå under standardvärdet 2 097 152. Sorteringsbufferten används för "
"vissa frågor med ORDER BY eller GROUP BY. Inställningen sort_buffer_size "
"styr hur mycket minne som tilldelas och kan behöva justeras om många "
"sorteringsfrågor körs. Variabeln gäller per session. Använd samma beräkning "
"som för join_buffer_size för att uppskatta minnet per anslutning."

#: lib/utility.php:1254
msgid ""
"InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible."
"  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as "
"much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the "
"/var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are "
"recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will "
"vary depending on your systems size.  If you database is very large or "
"remote, you can consider increasing this size.  If remote, it can by as high"
" as 80% of the systems memory.  However, cautions must be taken to reduce "
"the swappiness of the system, or to remove swap to keep the system from "
"swapping."
msgstr ""
"InnoDB behåller så många tabeller och index som möjligt i systemminnet. Gör "
"därför innodb_buffer_pool tillräckligt stor för att rymma så mycket som "
"möjligt av dem. Storleken på katalogen /var/lib/mysql/cacti kan hjälpa dig "
"att bestämma värdet. Rekommendationen är 25 % av systemets totala minne, men"
" behovet beror på systemets storlek. För en mycket stor databas eller en "
"databas på en separat server kan du överväga ett högre värde, upp till 80 % "
"av systemminnet på en separat server. Minska dock systemets benägenhet att "
"använda växlingsutrymme eller ta bort växlingsutrymmet för att undvika "
"växling."

